                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-3dac3b51-364e-47c0-a043-15b6d7a6c405">3dac3b51-364e-47c0-a043-15b6d7a6c405</a>
                </td>
                <td>Cirkulationsproblemer</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Vælges ved cirkulationsproblemer og uhensigtsmæssige kredsløbsforstyrelser.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Bleg og kold hud, ødemer, hypertension, hypotension, hjertearytmier, bradycardi eller takycardi.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;3dac3b51-364e-47c0-a043-15b6d7a6c405&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Cirkulationsproblemer&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
