                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-263a2c2f-7ae2-4264-8808-7e8216b1a118"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-263a2c2f-7ae2-4264-8808-7e8216b1a118">263a2c2f-7ae2-4264-8808-7e8216b1a118</a>
                </td>
                <td>Sår og cicatriser</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Fund vedrørende cicatriser, sår og andre hudlæsioner.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Arvævsdannelse, infektion omkring cicatrise og/eller manglende opheling.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;263a2c2f-7ae2-4264-8808-7e8216b1a118&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Sår og cicatriser&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;263a2c2f-7ae2-4264-8808-7e8216b1a118&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Sår og cicatriser&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-26b05040-94f3-4c8c-9ede-c7223bddf518"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-26b05040-94f3-4c8c-9ede-c7223bddf518">26b05040-94f3-4c8c-9ede-c7223bddf518</a>
                </td>
                <td>Respiration og cirkulation</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Fund vedrørende vejrtrækning  i relation til respirationssystemet, samt følger af påvirket blodgennemstrømning og venøst tilbageløb.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Respirationsfrekvens, respirationsrytme,  dyspnø, hyperventilering, ødemer.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;26b05040-94f3-4c8c-9ede-c7223bddf518&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Respiration og cirkulation&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
