                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-c6f49b84-58af-43df-bb3e-0d6a67fa0aba"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-c6f49b84-58af-43df-bb3e-0d6a67fa0aba">c6f49b84-58af-43df-bb3e-0d6a67fa0aba</a>
                </td>
                <td>Bevægeapparat</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Fund vedrørende muskelstyrke, ledbevægelighed og koordination.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Muskelstyrke, muskeltonus,  stabilitet i et eller flere led, koordination og viljebestemte bevægelser, muskeludholdenhed, ledbevægelighed.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;c6f49b84-58af-43df-bb3e-0d6a67fa0aba&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Bevægeapparat&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;c6f49b84-58af-43df-bb3e-0d6a67fa0aba&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Bevægeapparat&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-43f0b6da-11da-4eed-b00b-19b2177690b5"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-43f0b6da-11da-4eed-b00b-19b2177690b5">43f0b6da-11da-4eed-b00b-19b2177690b5</a>
                </td>
                <td>Håndtere genstande</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Beskrivelse af ændringer og fund relateret til evnen til fysisk at løfte, bære, flytte og håndtere genstande.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: At være i stand til at løfte, bære, håndtere eller styre maskiner eller redskaber i hverdagen.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;43f0b6da-11da-4eed-b00b-19b2177690b5&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Håndtere genstande&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
