                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;f0b62265-6c83-4239-af97-4d6e9ba9dea7&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Medicin og stoffer&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-f1f1eee3-a3ea-4ca1-bfa9-ebb381af1a1f"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-f1f1eee3-a3ea-4ca1-bfa9-ebb381af1a1f">f1f1eee3-a3ea-4ca1-bfa9-ebb381af1a1f</a>
                </td>
                <td>Fysisk aktivitet</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Beskrivelse af ændringer og fund relateret til borgerens fysiske aktivitetsniveau.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Hyppighed, intensitet i motionsmønster, uhensigtsmæssigt  motionsmønster eller inaktivitet.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;f1f1eee3-a3ea-4ca1-bfa9-ebb381af1a1f&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Fysisk aktivitet&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
