                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;7b6a52c6-7e0d-4800-a223-ebdd2c9261e4&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Emotionelle problemer&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-f7619a25-1f4f-4940-83b8-913a2da0ef47"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-f7619a25-1f4f-4940-83b8-913a2da0ef47">f7619a25-1f4f-4940-83b8-913a2da0ef47</a>
                </td>
                <td>Mentale problemer</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Brug for støtte til at håndtere psykiske og psykiatriske symptomer.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;f7619a25-1f4f-4940-83b8-913a2da0ef47&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Mentale problemer&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;f7619a25-1f4f-4940-83b8-913a2da0ef47&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Mentale problemer&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-5cc0c081-4b5a-4465-8635-7515768fbadc"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-5cc0c081-4b5a-4465-8635-7515768fbadc">5cc0c081-4b5a-4465-8635-7515768fbadc</a>
                </td>
                <td>Problemer med socialt samvær</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Vælges ved problemer med at håndtere socialt samvær eller overholde sociale normer.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Håndtere og etablere socialt samvær herunder aktiviteter i familien, foreninger og andre relationer, interagere med andre eller etablere og opretholde relationer.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;5cc0c081-4b5a-4465-8635-7515768fbadc&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Problemer med socialt samvær&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;5cc0c081-4b5a-4465-8635-7515768fbadc&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Problemer med socialt samvær&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-b754ce15-4de8-4ac6-8224-57432fd7cd6a"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-b754ce15-4de8-4ac6-8224-57432fd7cd6a">b754ce15-4de8-4ac6-8224-57432fd7cd6a</a>
                </td>
                <td>Problemer med trivsel</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Vælges ved problemer med psykiske eller psykiatriske symptomer og evnen til at håndtere følelser.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Vedvarende tristhed, sorg, savn, apati, rastløshed, vrede, ængstelighed, aggressivitet, stress, tankeforstyrrelser, tvangshandlinger.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;b754ce15-4de8-4ac6-8224-57432fd7cd6a&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Problemer med trivsel&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;b754ce15-4de8-4ac6-8224-57432fd7cd6a&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Problemer med trivsel&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-f7710e83-a2d3-4c17-bcf6-bd084aec2efb"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-f7710e83-a2d3-4c17-bcf6-bd084aec2efb">f7710e83-a2d3-4c17-bcf6-bd084aec2efb</a>
                </td>
                <td>Problemer med misbrug</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Vælges ved problemer med vedvarende og skadeligt brug af medicin, alkohol eller stoffer.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Abstinenssymptomer og psykiske eller sociale følger af et misbrug.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;f7710e83-a2d3-4c17-bcf6-bd084aec2efb&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Problemer med misbrug&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
