                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;I6.4&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Mentale problemer&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-I6.1"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-I6.461">I6.1</a>
                </td>
                <td>Problemer med socialt samvær</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Vælges ved problemer med at håndtere socialt samvær eller overholde sociale normer.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Håndtere og etablere socialt samvær herunder aktiviteter i familien, foreninger og andre relationer, interagere med andre eller etablere og opretholde relationer.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;I6.1&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Problemer med socialt samvær&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;I6.1&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Problemer med socialt samvær&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-Problemer_med_trivsel"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-Problemer_med_trivsel">Problemer_med_trivsel</a>
                </td>
                <td>Problemer med trivsel</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Vælges ved problemer med psykiske eller psykiatriske symptomer og evnen til at håndtere følelser.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Vedvarende tristhed, sorg, savn, apati, rastløshed, vrede, ængstelighed, aggressivitet, stress, tankeforstyrrelser, tvangshandlinger.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;Problemer_med_trivsel&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Problemer med trivsel&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;Problemer_med_trivsel&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Problemer med trivsel&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-I6.3"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-I6.463">I6.3</a>
                </td>
                <td>Problemer med misbrug</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Vælges ved problemer med vedvarende og skadeligt brug af medicin, alkohol eller stoffer.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Abstinenssymptomer og psykiske eller sociale følger af et misbrug.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;I6.3&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Problemer med misbrug&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;I6.3&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Problemer med misbrug&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-I7.2"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-I7.462">I7.2</a>
                </td>
                <td>Cirkulationsproblemer</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Vælges ved cirkulationsproblemer og uhensigtsmæssige kredsløbsforstyrelser.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Bleg og kold hud, ødemer, hypertension, hypotension, hjertearytmier, bradycardi eller takycardi.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;I7.2&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Cirkulationsproblemer&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
