                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-I8.1"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-I8.461">I8.1</a>
                </td>
                <td>Problemer med seksualitet</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Brug for støtte til seksuel aktivitet.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
