                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-65ca1484-390b-4f1e-ba14-86a170ba75b9">65ca1484-390b-4f1e-ba14-86a170ba75b9</a>
                </td>
                <td>Ødem</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Perifert ødem, lymfødem, postoperativt ødem, posttraumatisk ødem, ødem pga medicinering/bivirkninger</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;65ca1484-390b-4f1e-ba14-86a170ba75b9&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Ødem&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
