                </td>
                <td>Kropspleje</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Rede hår, børste tænder, barbere sig, lægge make-up, rense og klippe finger- og tånegle</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;dc2691db-fcc5-406f-a790-3c1f2f91c6b9&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Kropspleje&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
