                </td>
                <td>Balance</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Balance i stående stilling, balance i siddende stilling, balance under gang og bevægelse, svimmelhed, fornemmelse af at være ved at falde</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;1b5ad154-d22c-4949-a5db-c01ccefd64d9&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Balance&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
