              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-08042057-72f4-4798-a727-75ce6205dc86"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-08042057-72f4-4798-a727-75ce6205dc86">08042057-72f4-4798-a727-75ce6205dc86</a>
                </td>
                <td>Sociale relationer</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Beskrivelse af evne, lyst og vilje til at indgå i sociale relationer og netværk - omfatter familie, det umiddelbare netværk og større fællesskaber.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Deltage i familieliv, selskabelighed, sport, leg eller fornøjelse sammen med andre.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;08042057-72f4-4798-a727-75ce6205dc86&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Sociale relationer&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;08042057-72f4-4798-a727-75ce6205dc86&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Sociale relationer&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-fab34c19-4805-45af-b961-56099c849744"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-fab34c19-4805-45af-b961-56099c849744">fab34c19-4805-45af-b961-56099c849744</a>
                </td>
                <td>Daglige aktiviteter</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Beskrivelse af ændringer og fund relateret til basale aktiviteter i hverdagen. At kunne planlægge, strukturere, administrere og udføre aktiviteter i løbet dagen.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Planlægge indkøb, strukturere og administrere tid og energi i forhold til forskellige aktiviteter - skole/arbejde/hobby eller motionsaktiviteter.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;fab34c19-4805-45af-b961-56099c849744&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Daglige aktiviteter&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;fab34c19-4805-45af-b961-56099c849744&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Daglige aktiviteter&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-1a34ed6c-083b-451f-b8c8-137f99126b0c"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-1a34ed6c-083b-451f-b8c8-137f99126b0c">1a34ed6c-083b-451f-b8c8-137f99126b0c</a>
                </td>
                <td>Tobak og nikotin</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Beskrivelse af ændringer og fund relateret til brug af tobak og andre nikotinprodukter.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Cigaretter, pibe, vandpibe, e-cigaretter, snus, andre nikotinprodukter. Borgere, der oplever tilbagefald i forbindelse med ophør.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;1a34ed6c-083b-451f-b8c8-137f99126b0c&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Tobak og nikotin&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;1a34ed6c-083b-451f-b8c8-137f99126b0c&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Tobak og nikotin&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-57b8979f-cf46-4312-aafa-3a0dd93aa921"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-57b8979f-cf46-4312-aafa-3a0dd93aa921">57b8979f-cf46-4312-aafa-3a0dd93aa921</a>
                </td>
                <td>Alkohol</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Beskrivelse af ændringer og fund relateret til alkohol.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Uhensigtsmæssig drikkefrekvens, drikkevaner og/eller manglende evne til at kontrollere drikkemønster. Afvise eller vedkende sig brugen af alkohol.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;57b8979f-cf46-4312-aafa-3a0dd93aa921&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Alkohol&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;57b8979f-cf46-4312-aafa-3a0dd93aa921&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Alkohol&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-bb7e9e71-73f6-4ec6-a0bf-eaec1e5982b4"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-bb7e9e71-73f6-4ec6-a0bf-eaec1e5982b4">bb7e9e71-73f6-4ec6-a0bf-eaec1e5982b4</a>
                </td>
                <td>Sundhedskompetence</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Beskrivelse af ændringer og fund relateret til at finde, forstå, vurdere og bruge informationer til at tage beslutninger om sundhed og handle herefter.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Samarbejde og kontakt med sundhedsvæsenet, indsigt i eget helbred og behandling.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;bb7e9e71-73f6-4ec6-a0bf-eaec1e5982b4&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Sundhedskompetence&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;bb7e9e71-73f6-4ec6-a0bf-eaec1e5982b4&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Sundhedskompetence&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-f0b62265-6c83-4239-af97-4d6e9ba9dea7"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-f0b62265-6c83-4239-af97-4d6e9ba9dea7">f0b62265-6c83-4239-af97-4d6e9ba9dea7</a>
                </td>
                <td>Medicin og stoffer</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Beskrivelse af ændringer eller fund relateret til uhensigtsmæssig indtagelse af medicin og stoffer.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Uhensigtsmæssigt forbrug eller misbrug af håndkøbsmedicin, ordinerede lægemidler og narkorelaterede stoffer.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;f0b62265-6c83-4239-af97-4d6e9ba9dea7&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Medicin og stoffer&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;f0b62265-6c83-4239-af97-4d6e9ba9dea7&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Medicin og stoffer&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-f1f1eee3-a3ea-4ca1-bfa9-ebb381af1a1f"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-f1f1eee3-a3ea-4ca1-bfa9-ebb381af1a1f">f1f1eee3-a3ea-4ca1-bfa9-ebb381af1a1f</a>
                </td>
                <td>Fysisk aktivitet</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Beskrivelse af ændringer og fund relateret til borgerens fysiske aktivitetsniveau.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Hyppighed, intensitet i motionsmønster, uhensigtsmæssigt  motionsmønster eller inaktivitet.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;f1f1eee3-a3ea-4ca1-bfa9-ebb381af1a1f&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Fysisk aktivitet&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;f1f1eee3-a3ea-4ca1-bfa9-ebb381af1a1f&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Fysisk aktivitet&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-f715168e-125b-4d00-8e93-2ca4147ed13f"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-f715168e-125b-4d00-8e93-2ca4147ed13f">f715168e-125b-4d00-8e93-2ca4147ed13f</a>
                </td>
                <td>Spisemønster</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Beskrivelse af ændringer og fund vedr. uhensigtsmæssigheder relateret til borgerens spisemønster.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Hyppighed af måltider, varieret kost og mængder af mad der indtages.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;f715168e-125b-4d00-8e93-2ca4147ed13f&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Spisemønster&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;f715168e-125b-4d00-8e93-2ca4147ed13f&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Spisemønster&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-525b5dd8-d62b-4efa-bf66-262ac47eca5b"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-525b5dd8-d62b-4efa-bf66-262ac47eca5b">525b5dd8-d62b-4efa-bf66-262ac47eca5b</a>
                </td>
                <td>Emotionel funktion</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Mentale funktioner forbundet med følelser og affektive komponenter i sindet. Fx følelse af nedtrykthed, stressende situationer, ængstelighed eller bekymring, i forbindelse med at have en kronisk lidelse.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;525b5dd8-d62b-4efa-bf66-262ac47eca5b&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Emotionel funktion&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;525b5dd8-d62b-4efa-bf66-262ac47eca5b&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Emotionel funktion&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-0520a107-2bb0-47b8-8856-c53e27607e51"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-0520a107-2bb0-47b8-8856-c53e27607e51">0520a107-2bb0-47b8-8856-c53e27607e51</a>
                </td>
                <td>Kognitiv funktion</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Beskrivelse af ændringer og fund relateret til evnen til at forstå, ræsonnere, reflektere.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: At være i stand til at problemløse og indlære, samt til beslutningstagning.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;0520a107-2bb0-47b8-8856-c53e27607e51&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Kognitiv funktion&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;0520a107-2bb0-47b8-8856-c53e27607e51&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Kognitiv funktion&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-43ad3091-f684-4d6f-8885-20ecd1cf2255"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-43ad3091-f684-4d6f-8885-20ecd1cf2255">43ad3091-f684-4d6f-8885-20ecd1cf2255</a>
                </td>
                <td>Kropspfattelse</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Beskrivelse af ændringer og fund relateret til kropsopfattelse.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: At finde sig til rette med en ændret eller forstyrret kropsopfattelse, som kan skyldes ændringer i oplevelsen af egen seksualitet eller intimitet, i forbindelse med at have en kronisk lidelse.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;43ad3091-f684-4d6f-8885-20ecd1cf2255&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Kropspfattelse&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;43ad3091-f684-4d6f-8885-20ecd1cf2255&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Kropspfattelse&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-ba083ca7-fe46-41d0-acd5-85851ac8137f"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-ba083ca7-fe46-41d0-acd5-85851ac8137f">ba083ca7-fe46-41d0-acd5-85851ac8137f</a>
                </td>
                <td>Trivsel</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Beskrivelse af ændringer og fund relateret til  håndtering af egen livssituation og følelser forbundet hermed.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Følelse af nedtrykthed, oplevelse af stress, ængstelighed eller bekymring i forbindelse med at have en kronisk lidelse.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;ba083ca7-fe46-41d0-acd5-85851ac8137f&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Trivsel&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;ba083ca7-fe46-41d0-acd5-85851ac8137f&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Trivsel&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-cb55874a-93d9-45c7-a25a-8ff677c24385"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-cb55874a-93d9-45c7-a25a-8ff677c24385">cb55874a-93d9-45c7-a25a-8ff677c24385</a>
                </td>
                <td>Søvn og hvile</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Beskrivelse af ændringer og fund relateret til søvn og hvilemønster.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Indvirkningen på de nære omgivelser, på familiens livsstil, det daglige aktivitetsmønster og borgerens fysiske form.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;cb55874a-93d9-45c7-a25a-8ff677c24385&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Søvn og hvile&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;cb55874a-93d9-45c7-a25a-8ff677c24385&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Søvn og hvile&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </div>
