                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-eec8fc0a-7a30-49ea-ba3d-1c1d3cb50bfb">eec8fc0a-7a30-49ea-ba3d-1c1d3cb50bfb</a>
                </td>
                <td>Oplevelse af egen krop</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Følelse af at være for tyk eller for tynd, fantomoplevelser af kropsdele, neglekt for en del af kroppen</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;eec8fc0a-7a30-49ea-ba3d-1c1d3cb50bfb&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Oplevelse af egen krop&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
