                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-56860429-eabe-4d48-b8ad-d7f7b28f6df5">56860429-eabe-4d48-b8ad-d7f7b28f6df5</a>
                </td>
                <td>Hukommelse</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Evnen til at kunne registrere, lagre og genkalde sig informationer efter behov.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Korttidshukommelse, langtidshukommelse, arbejdshukommelse, huske aftaler, steder og personer.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;56860429-eabe-4d48-b8ad-d7f7b28f6df5&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Hukommelse&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
