                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;4a4add40-ee74-4090-bd70-48d9bda9c5c4&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Udskillelser&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-a3af0522-e228-4a6a-b5c2-c9fcf0f3b2c4"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-a3af0522-e228-4a6a-b5c2-c9fcf0f3b2c4">a3af0522-e228-4a6a-b5c2-c9fcf0f3b2c4</a>
                </td>
                <td>Tilsyn/omsorg</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Indsatsen er ikke er forbundet med en konkret opgave, men handler om at give psykisk støtte og tryghed hos borgeren.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Tilsynsbesøg, omsorgsbesøg, tryghedsbesøg, støttebesøg, psykisk pleje.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;a3af0522-e228-4a6a-b5c2-c9fcf0f3b2c4&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Tilsyn/omsorg&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
