                </td>
                <td>Rengøring</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Indsatsen omfatter hjælp, støtte eller guidning ifm. den daglige rengøring og hovedrengøring.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Støvsugning, aftørring, gulvvask, hovedrengøring, skift af sengelinned, snerydning.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;43608562-e356-4990-8b96-e35128bbdc4f&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Rengøring&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
