                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-0204a44a-29ca-4ac0-9f08-a8dcb35b44d9">0204a44a-29ca-4ac0-9f08-a8dcb35b44d9</a>
                </td>
                <td>Vejledning</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Indsatsen omfatter typisk samtale om, hvordan borgeren kan håndtere og agere ift. fysiske, psykiske, sociale og åndelige potentielle og/eller aktuelle tilstande, fx hvordan borgeren søger kommunale indsatser, eller hvordan konflikter kan håndteres.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;0204a44a-29ca-4ac0-9f08-a8dcb35b44d9&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Vejledning&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;0204a44a-29ca-4ac0-9f08-a8dcb35b44d9&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Vejledning&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-4374f01c-494b-4fc6-9d95-a0022fa515cf"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-4374f01c-494b-4fc6-9d95-a0022fa515cf">4374f01c-494b-4fc6-9d95-a0022fa515cf</a>
                </td>
                <td>Psykiatrisk pleje</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Indsatsen omfatter typisk opbygning af relation, støtte til at få praktisk og mental struktur i dagligdagen, fx til håndtering og accept af psykiatriske symptomer, diagnoser, behandling og afledte problemer.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;4374f01c-494b-4fc6-9d95-a0022fa515cf&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Psykiatrisk pleje&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;4374f01c-494b-4fc6-9d95-a0022fa515cf&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Psykiatrisk pleje&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-476708f4-505d-4575-9e1f-e9dadb7d7759"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
