                </td>
                <td>Mobilitet</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Indsatsen omfatter omfatter hjælp, støtte eller guidning ifm. mobilitet eller ændringer i kroppens stilling og placering.</p>

                    <p>Eksempler: Forflytning, lejring, vending.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;ef8ee035-00d2-48b9-b366-27753ccd5504&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Mobilitet&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
