                </td>
                <td>Trakeostomipleje</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Indsatsen omfatter typisk skift af trakealkanyle, skift af forbinding og pleje af hud ved indstikssted.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;1cb4bf0a-da39-44fa-b9c8-52093d3ae956&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Trakeostomipleje&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
