                </td>
                <td>Nonfarmakologisk smertelindring</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Indsatsen omfatter nonfarmakologisk behandling/lindring af smerter, fx vejledning i visualiseringsøvelser, massage og kulde-/varmebehandling.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;a0c9f295-7608-4d80-b6e7-fb37908b330a&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Nonfarmakologisk smertelindring&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
