              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-d7ff926a-4955-478f-b300-0b0ec0785013"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-d7ff926a-4955-478f-b300-0b0ec0785013">d7ff926a-4955-478f-b300-0b0ec0785013</a>
                </td>
                <td>9</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Ikke relevant.</p>

                    <p>Ikke relevant anvendes for at vise, at der aktivt er taget stilling til området, og at den manglende vurdering ikke skyldes en forglemmelse.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;d7ff926a-4955-478f-b300-0b0ec0785013&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;9&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
