              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-B1"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-B1">B1</a>
                </td>
                <td>0</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Ingen/ubetydelige begrænsninger.</p>

                    <p>Borgeren er selvstændig og har ikke behov for støtte eller person assistance til at udføre aktiviteten med eller uden hjælpemiddel.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;B1&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;0&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;B1&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-B6"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-B6">B6</a>
                </td>
                <td>9</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Ikke relevant.</p>

                    <p>Ikke relevant anvendes for at vise, at der aktivt er taget stilling til området, og at den manglende vurdering ikke skyldes en forglemmelse.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;B6&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;9&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;B6&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-B3"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-B3">B3</a>
                </td>
                <td>2</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Moderate begrænsninger.</p>

                    <p>Borgeren er den aktive part og kan under forudsætning af moderat person assistance udføre aktiviteten. Borgeren er aktiv men har behov for moderat hjælp.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;B3&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;2&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;B3&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-B5"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-B5">B5</a>
                </td>
                <td>4</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Totale begrænsninger.</p>

                    <p>Borgeren er ude af stand til at udføre aktiviteten og har brug for fuldstændig personassistance for at udføre aktiviteten. Borgeren kan ikke selv og får hjælp til alt.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;B5&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;4&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;2.4.0&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;B5&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21-B2"> </a>
                  <code>urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-FSIII.html#FSIII-B2">B2</a>
                </td>
                <td>1</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Lette begrænsninger.</p>

                    <p>Borgeren er den aktive part og kan med let person assistance udføre aktiviten. Borgeren er aktiv og har kun behov for lidt hjælp til at udføre aktiviteten.</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.21&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.4.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;B2&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;1&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
